============================================================
5. CRITIQUE AGENT
============================================================

The Critique Agent evaluates four main areas:

1. Completeness
2. Accuracy
3. Relevance
4. Structure


------------------------------------------------------------
QUALITY SCORE EXAMPLE
------------------------------------------------------------

Completeness:
Score  = 0.70
Weight = 40%

0.70 × 0.40 = 0.280


Accuracy:
Score  = 0.85
Weight = 30%

0.85 × 0.30 = 0.255


Relevance:
Score  = 0.80
Weight = 20%

0.80 × 0.20 = 0.160


Structure:
Score  = 0.75
Weight = 10%

0.75 × 0.10 = 0.075


Total Quality Score:

0.280
+ 0.255
+ 0.160
+ 0.075
-------------
= 0.770

Overall Quality = 0.77

Required Threshold = 0.80

0.77 < 0.80

Decision:

REFINE


