6. CRITIQUE OUTPUT EXAMPLE
============================================================

Overall Score:
0.77

Gaps:

1. Missing recent AI agent developments
   Severity = HIGH

2. No practical implementation examples
   Severity = HIGH

3. Edge cases not documented
   Severity = MEDIUM

4. Some sections are unclear
