26. INTERVIEW-READY EXPLANATION
============================================================

Research → Critique → Refine is a multi-agent pattern where
different AI agents have specialized responsibilities.

The Research Agent collects information.

The Critique Agent evaluates the information and identifies
quality gaps.

The Quality Gate checks whether the quality meets the
required threshold.

If quality is below the threshold, the Refine Agent improves
the content using the critique feedback.

The result is then critiqued again.

The loop stops when:

- Required quality is achieved, OR
- Maximum iterations are reached, OR
- Further improvement becomes insignificant.


